<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent clashes persist between the Viv Ansanm gangs and Haitian security forces, now reinforced by a Kenya-led multinational mission patrolling Port-au-Prince and Kenscoff. The Dominican army has supplied large ammunition stocks to the 400 Mawozo gang, increasing its firepower, while Taiwan has offered security experience sharing with Haiti. Mayor Jean Massillon of Kenscoff, who warned about gang violence, has died. The European Union provided four million euros for the PMSAN 2 Food Security Program, and the UCDP recorded 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNZUQwWXpVMHR6Q1AxNFUwMGV5Rnc0XzhzN21LUDVWaUZQTEp3QUdtYVFIRy1FUFdJdXJTejA1V010UlBib004TEtjU1RWeXVNRHhCTmFRdndHQ1lsZzVYZEtZdXBDLUlINDVEbm1kQ2NkR05GTnB3R2toN1VJRFUtRVRFWi1XXy02d1FBRElzak5tYTFnZWJVMDBEVDMyY3ZnMXBSNW90OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1PSDNZYklwbFlURFR4ZWw5TXBzM2kxUUV5SEZfZHFESFdkUVU2Q2tKUHZJSzBNeFNGZmlfTUQtb0pzaFJZNllRRjNMajF1RkJBdkNkcGF4aHVabFF4TzNteUhEQWVsazkxMnhJeFdSZVZfekluWW8xZjJSX2VYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trinidad Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPdWFpMVJ3QmdxcVlvWVhlaXNqeWVDYlZhSnRfcWxkWkxZY3JBQjJZUF9aVUtEeWVhNHlQZUxrMDc1TFQzZk5zeDRFSy04SG1YbWwxc3ZaV3ZKRGt2UHlQb09PbktZTjQ0aXRfNFdxY3VCcndVMktmd1YyZG5ra3BMZ2phQi1IV3EyTUJreWl3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
